* {{ill|Ávila|en|Avila, Spain}}
* {{ill|Carcassonne|en|Carcassonne}} (France)
* {{ill|Dubrovnik|en|Dubrovnik}} (Croatia)

=== Middle East ===
* {{ill|Aleppo|en|Aleppo}} (Syria)
* {{ill|Old City of Jerusalem|en|Old City of Jerusalem}}

=== Asia ===
; China
* {{ill|Pingyao|en|Pingyao}}
* {{ill|Xi'an|en|Xi'an}}
; India
* {{ill|Jaisalmer|en|Jaisalmer}}
* {{ill|Delhi|en|Delhi}}

=== North America ===
* {{ill|Quebec City|en|Quebec City}} (Canada)

